  <scopecontent id="f6a658247fba4c0e48d29f1d048b71ec">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The Population Council Index provides indexing to the Council's General File (1952-1961) and the Council's Central Files (1961-1976), which include the Administration File, Foreign Correspondence, Grant Files, Organization File, and Subject File.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <arrangement id="3145bccfed2683836070b3303658f589">
    <head>Arrangement</head>
<p>The index is arranged in three series: 1. General File Index (1952-1961); 2. Central File Index (1961-1976); and 3. Central File Title List (1961-1976).</p>  </arrangement>
  <accessrestrict id="252b98ee1b257d94b9b5b0ff231eaa8b">
    <head>Conditions Governing Access</head>
<p>Index cards are open for research.</p>  </accessrestrict>
  <userestrict id="6698a25fb5c382912fad539df3650039">
