<p>The Population Council retains title, copyright and literary rights in the collection, in so far as it holds them.</p><p>The Rockefeller Archive Center has authority to grant permission to cite and publish material from the collection for purposes. The Population Council retains the right to prior consent with respect to any reproduction or extensive quotation of the records for publication.</p><p>Reproduction/duplication of archival items is routinely provided in accordance with "fair use". If the RAC does not hold copyright for an archival collection, or items within a collection, it is the users responsibility to contact the copyright holder, or make a fair effort to do so, prior to publication. </p>  </userestrict>
  <dsc><c id="eab56812bd759c0e8547025b3522a7e0" level="series"><did><unittitle>General File Index</unittitle><unitid>1</unitid><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969477</unitid><physdesc altrender="whole"><extent altrender="materialtype spaceoccupied">0.56 Cubic Feet</extent><extent altrender="carrier">4 card file boxes</extent><physfacet>index cards</physfacet><dimensions>3.5 x 5 x 12 inches each.</dimensions></physdesc><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1952/1961" type="inclusive">1952-1961</unitdate></did><scopecontent id="5aa4aa9f91d3aea4a38bdae3f0c41483"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>The Population Council's General File Index provides indexing to be found in
<extref xlink:href="../FA210/overview">FA210 Population Council records Accession 1, Series 1: General File, 1952-1961</extref></p><p>Individual documents are indicated on the index cards by the alphabetically arranged file titles within the General File.</p></scopecontent><bioghist id="63d79c5b4016ee1eb9ab3f1d942871b1"><head>Biographical / Historical</head><p>From 1952-1961 the Population Council maintained a single 'General File' of correspondence, memoranda, and reports, arranged alphabetically by file title. Indexing was provided by the General File Index, which included headings for personal names and organizations.</p></bioghist><c id="ffdc44b60b95b212e723735187dd46ed" level="file"><did><unittitle>A - D</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969488</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="f9f9d9e4a9bdc9325820d903e90c3d60" label="mixed materials [A0000000073972]" type="box">1</container></did></c><c id="75a72aeb6c783b687a4b7767517017b1" level="file"><did><unittitle>E - KIRK</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969489</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="2fab9564d5a62848d019cf1a90aead69" label="mixed materials [A0000000073973]" type="box">2</container></did></c><c id="55bda90bf14862ac85d38f6b3ba68ace" level="file"><did><unittitle>KIRK - Q</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969490</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="a72267569d351c0504339274d73ec82d" label="mixed materials [A0000000073974]" type="box">3</container></did></c><c id="a854b301fcbf88a990bae158c9b2e7cc" level="file"><did><unittitle>R - Z</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969491</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="f5367778cd18e9fb509ee5f457b6d06e" label="mixed materials [A0000000073975]" type="box">4</container></did></c></c><c id="481ef2e685d93ce1fa262820d70a135f" level="series"><did><unittitle>Central File Index</unittitle><unitid>2</unitid><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969478</unitid><physdesc altrender="whole"><extent altrender="materialtype spaceoccupied">2.92 Cubic Feet</extent><extent altrender="carrier">21 card file boxes</extent><physfacet>index cards</physfacet><dimensions>3.5 x 5 x 12 inches each.</dimensions></physdesc><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1961/1976" type="inclusive">1961-1976</unitdate></did><scopecontent id="f00a9d5b148680f0e04c9f0ebc88b628"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Provides indexing to the Population Council's Central Files, which includes the Administration File, Foreign Correspondence, Grant Files, Organization File, and Subject File.</p><p>The Population Council's Central Files can be found in both:</p><p><extref xlink:href="../FA210/overview">FA210 Population Council records Accession 1</extref></p><p><extref xlink:href="../FA432/overview">FA432 Population Council records, Accession 2</extref></p></scopecontent><odd id="ba23fff84dcf71d0cdd294ff16176e8b"><head>General</head><p>The Central Files Index cards use notations to indicate specific records series within the Population Council's Central Files.  See the key below to decipher these notations.</p><list type="deflist"><head>Key to Central File Index notations</head><defitem><label>"AD - (name) - (file title)"</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 3. Administration File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"Admin. - (name) - (file title)"</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 3. Administration File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"D (YY).(###)" (Grant ID number, Demographic Division)</label><item>Search DIMES for the grant ID number.</item></defitem><defitem><label>"D&amp;I - AD - (name) - (file title)"</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 3. Administration File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"D&amp;I - O (file title)", dated from 1961-1966</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 1 (FA210), Series 1. Organization File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"D&amp;I - O (file title)", dated from 1967-1976</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 4. Organization File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"D&amp;I - S (file title)", dated from 1961-1966</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 1 (FA210), Series 5. Subject File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"D&amp;I - S (file title)", dated from 1967-1976</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 4. Subject File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"FC - (country name) - (file title)"</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 2. Foreign Correspondence</item></defitem><defitem><label>"M (YY).(###)" (Grant ID number, Biomedical Division)</label><item>Search DIMES for the grant ID number.</item></defitem><defitem><label>"O - (file title)", dated from 1961-1966</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 1 (FA210), Series 4. Organization File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"O - (file title)", dated from 1967-1976</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 4. Organization File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"S - (file title)", dated from 1961-1966</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 1 (FA210), Series 5. Subject File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"S - (file title)", dated from 1967-1976</label><item>See: Population Council records, Accession 2 (FA432), Series 4. Subject File</item></defitem><defitem><label>"T (YY).(###)"  (Grant ID number, Technical Division)</label><item>Search DIMES for the grant ID number.</item></defitem></list></odd><bioghist id="e02ac4db2cc4a918b0c95ff1b4dee58d"><head>Biographical / Historical</head><p>In 1961-1962 the Population Council contracted Records Management Research to review the Council's filing system and make recommendations. Following this review the Council established a Central Files Unit to receive and file documents under specific subject titles, and to maintain a card index system for documents cross-referencing. The Council's Central Files Unit maintained several series of records, including the Administration File, Foreign Correspondence, Grant Files, Organization File, and Subject File.  </p><p>The Central File unit was in operation until 1976, when inactive Population Council records were transferred to the Rockefeller Archive Center.</p></bioghist><c id="0a4c6264b06d2e39315245d3290fa381" level="file"><did><unittitle>A - Aspefam</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969492</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="423a82dbacfb817669f331e08dfb4277" label="Microform [A0000000073976]" type="box">5</container></did></c><c id="501a2cec7bc5501b0dafa8d4cbbfc429" level="file"><did><unittitle>Aspen - BOG</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969493</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="85b03507cfeb2850c662417ebfb7692a" label="Microform [A0000000073977]" type="box">6</container></did></c><c id="aefad71d2f047ec80ce10f8ffd94c2fd" level="file"><did><unittitle>BOH - Centro</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969494</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="a2d470cd2d98ee403474e0978204fb5e" label="Microform [A0000000073978]" type="box">7</container></did></c><c id="31012f4cb1ac926500e2588cc0270f1b" level="file"><did><unittitle>Centrum - Corning</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969495</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Card File Box" id="1ffbdd47b367d3238c04f88ca929a266" label="Microform [A0000000073979]" type="box">8</container></did></c><c id="2bfb0fdd39357c6b93c5922f7be146b3" level="file"><did><unittitle>Cornwall - Doyle</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/969496</unitid><container altrender="3 x 5 Ca